      "id": 1548,
      "hub_id": 2118,
      "guid": "com.sheepy.simpleseasondetector",
      "name": "Simple Season Selector",
      "slug": "simple-season-selector",
      "teaser": "Wish you could select the season in SPT instead of relying on the inevitable passage of time? Now you can.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2118.png",
      "downloads": 22942,
      "favourites_count": 1,
      "description": "<p>Yep, I finally did it, made my first proper mod. This one is fairly straightforward: instead of SPT determining what season the game should be based on the date, you can force a specific one using this mod.</p>\n<p>To disable seasonal events, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2440-disable-seasonal-events/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kuromi’s Disable Seasonal Events</a>.</p>\n<p>To randomly select seasons, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2610-random-season-ripoff\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Random Season Ripoff</a>.</p>\n<p>To complexly select seasons, use a mod like <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2745-seasonaloverride-dynamicweather/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Season Override &amp; Dynamic Weather</a>.</p>\n<p>Installation:</p>\n<p>Drag and drop the content of the archive into your SPT folder. Please use <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7zip</a>.</p>\n<p>Configuration:</p>\n<p>You can set the desired season inside<br />\nuser\\mods\\Sheepy-SimpleSeasonSelector\\config\\config.jsonc<br />\nUse notepad to edit it. In case something went wrong, it will automatically pick Auto.</p>\n<p>Special thanks go to Chomp for making the mod examples and AcidPhantasm for parts of the code and feedback.</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1548/simple-season-selector",
      "fika_compatibility": false,
